UI\n- Fast-access XR passthrough\n- **2.0/5.1/7.1** surround audio with HRTF\n- Custom C99 Vulkan engine optimized for Quest hardware\n- Low battery draw (~**3 hours playback**)\n\n# What's Next\n- **90 FPS 3D playback for any 2D video** locally on Quest 3 \n- Multi-wall setup (up to **5 surround walls**)\n- Streamer for Windows, macOS, and Linux\n- USB OTG support for external drives\n- Subtitles, bookmarks, and video looping\n- 180\u00b0, 360\u00b0, EAC, 3D (SBS, TTB) and 8K video support\n- Image and music support with background playback\n- Ambisonic spatial audio with custom speaker placement\n- Headset audio streaming to PC speakers", "short_description": "Turn your archive into a living video wall.\nTile up to 300 videos, hover to play instantly.\nEnter VAMP, Video Archive Mosaic Player."}]}, "developer_name": "BAZED", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vamp.video/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BAZED", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vamp.video/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28967588942859068"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_886063821106673_69983372182348499_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yv_Y--kGERsQ7kNvwFA_FAy&_nc_oc=AdqlARjjidwYjLEWFvrXL9PQIc8_G